# SkyGlass License Server - environment variables
#
# The server does not load .env files itself. Export these in the service
# environment (systemd Environment=/EnvironmentFile=, PM2 env, Docker env), or
# run locally with: node --env-file=.env dist/server.js
#
# Data: the SQLite database is stored at packages/license-server/data/licenses.db
# (created on first start) unless LICENSE_DATA_DIR points elsewhere.

# Port the HTTP server listens on (default: 3002)
PORT=3002

# Directory holding licenses.db (default: packages/license-server/data)
# LICENSE_DATA_DIR=/var/lib/skyglass-license

# REQUIRED. Shared secret for the protected admin/internal routes
# (POST /api/v1/licenses, POST /api/v1/licenses/reset, GET /api/v1/licenses).
# Clients must send "Authorization: Bearer <LICENSE_API_KEY>".
# If unset, those routes return 503 (fail closed). The website's Stripe
# webhook (packages/website/api/webhook.ts) must be configured with the SAME
# value so it can create licenses after checkout.
# Generate one with: openssl rand -hex 32
LICENSE_API_KEY=
